---
const pains = [
  {
    title: 'Stock walks out between shifts',
    body: 'A crate short on Monday, two bottles on Friday. Nobody counted when the shift changed, so nobody knows whose shift it was.',
  },
  {
    title: 'M-Pesa codes you can’t trust',
    body: 'A code written on paper might be real, used twice, or for KES 50 when the bill was 500. You only find out at the end of the month.',
  },
  {
    title: 'Shortages with no name on them',
    body: 'When the numbers don’t add up, it’s one person’s word against another’s, and the owner pays for the difference.',
  },
];
---

<section class="border-y border-slate-800 bg-slate-900/40">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-16">
    <h2 class="max-w-2xl text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-balance">
      Every bar loses money the same few ways
    </h2>
    <div class="mt-10 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3">
      {pains.map((p) => (
        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-800 bg-slate-950 p-6">
          <h3 class="font-semibold text-rose-300">{p.title}</h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-slate-300">{p.body}</p>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
